Third-party components

The OpenCore bootloader, kext bundles, ACPI binaries and UEFI drivers included
in this repository were produced by their respective upstream projects and
remain under their own licenses:

- OpenCorePkg, Lilu, VirtualSMC, WhateverGreen, AppleALC, BrightnessKeys,
  RestrictEvents, VoodooPS2, BrcmPatchRAM (BlueToolFixup) — BSD-3-Clause /
  APSL, Acidanthera (https://github.com/acidanthera)
- VoodooI2C, VoodooI2CHID — GPL-2.0,
  https://github.com/VoodooI2C/VoodooI2C
- IntelBluetoothFirmware, IntelBTPatcher, AirportItlwm — GPL-2.0,
  https://github.com/OpenIntelWireless
- USBToolBox, UTBMap — BSD-3-Clause,
  https://github.com/USBToolBox
- RealtekRTL8111 — GPL-2.0,
  https://github.com/Mieze/RTL8111_driver_for_OS_X
- CtlnaAHCIPort — see upstream repository,
  https://github.com/Ctlna/CtlnaAHCIPort

Redistribution of these components must follow their original license terms.
